        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Catatan deployment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Offline-only: manifest tanpa izin INTERNET; tidak ada server atau cloud saat runtime.&lt;br&gt;• Satu HP = satu toko; semua data di henshin.sqlite, backup manual lewat share sheet.&lt;br&gt;• Risiko: APK release masih ditandatangani debug key (android/app/build.gradle.kts)." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#E9D58A;fontColor=#1B1F24;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
